sde (0.1.0~alpha15) unstable; urgency=medium

  * New native applications written from scratch by the DebION Dev-Team
    replace the MATE forks: Niny (text editor), Xanara (PDF viewer and
    editor), Taca (archive manager), Photo and SDE System Monitor.
  * Gallery: menus, storage devices (USB/SD) with import, and two-way
    integration with Photo.
  * Start Menu: categories fit without scrolling, wheel scrolling fixed,
    slimmer, 12 Favorites plus Recently used (frequency and recency).
  * Settings: Computer desktop icon, wallpaper gallery from
    /usr/share/backgrounds, graphics card details in About, Sound, Network
    and Bluetooth pages opened directly from the panel.
  * Liria: Clear recent files, reliable copies to USB drives with a final
    flush, cross-application copy/paste.
  * Performance: partial repaints, server-side wallpaper and icons, lite
    compositor profile for VMs and software rendering.
  * Network: NetworkManager connectivity check and debion-network-check in
    debion-desktop-base.

 -- Hugo Moniz do Rego <hugomonizdorego@angelinojoana.com>  Wed, 21 Oct 2026 18:00:00 +0900

sde (0.1.0~alpha14) unstable; urgency=medium

  * Gallery is back: sde-gallery, a new photo library written by the DebION
    Dev-Team (month grid, favorites, folders, viewer, slideshow, thumbnail
    cache, Edit in Photo, Set as Wallpaper).
  * Tray icons open their own flyouts (Sound, Network, Bluetooth, Power,
    Media, Drives, Keyboard, Tray) instead of the Action Center.
  * Action Center redesign: tiles, sliders, media, calendar merged in, a
    Notifications card; compact and expanded modes; the clock opens it at
    the calendar.
  * Start Menu redesign: working search focus with caret and suggestions,
    Favorites as large tiles in pages, All Programs A-Z list, category pages,
    file search.
  * SDE Update redesign: grouped updates, details and changelogs, progress
    and cancel, History, Sources, Maintenance, Settings, background checks.
  * Liria: Home overview (quick access, drives with usage, recent files),
    one-row command bar, new sidebar sections, styled in every SDE theme.
  * SDE-FLTK: the DebION Dev-Team fork of FLTK 1.3.11, kept in sde-fltk/.
  * sde-xsettingsd and sde-polkit-agent written from scratch.

 -- Hugo Moniz do Rego <hugomonizdorego@angelinojoana.com>  Tue, 20 Oct 2026 22:00:00 +0900

sde (0.1.0~alpha13) unstable; urgency=medium

  * Fix the panel crash ("panel keeps stopping", SIGSEGV ~5 s after login):
    a D-Bus call that timed out (org.bluez on machines without Bluetooth)
    freed its timeout while SDE re-armed it. Watches are guarded the same
    way. Regression test added.
  * sde-session restarts a panel that keeps crashing in safe mode; SDE
    programs write a backtrace to session.log when they crash.
  * New tray icons that show the real state (Wi-Fi strength, wired,
    offline, volume, battery and charging, Bluetooth connected, keyboard
    layout, Do Not Disturb); USB drive, Bluetooth, media and battery icons
    appear only while that hardware or source exists (udev hotplug).
  * The Action Center has its own button in the panel corner; the clock
    opens the calendar.
  * Own ecosystem: the SDE toolkit (FLTK 1.3.11, static), sde-xsettingsd
    and sde-polkit-agent are built from pinned sources like SDE WM and the
    SDE compositor; no distribution FLTK, xsettingsd or polkit agent needed.

 -- Hugo Moniz do Rego <hugomonizdorego@angelinojoana.com>  Tue, 20 Oct 2026 12:00:00 +0900

sde (0.1.0~alpha12) unstable; urgency=medium

  * Fix the black screen after login in virtual machines: the compositor
    uses XRender (no blur) in VirtualBox, VMware, QEMU/KVM and Hyper-V, and
    sde-session replaces a compositor that draws a black screen (XRender,
    then off). Alt+Shift+F12 and "sde-session --compositor" toggle it.
  * Autostart no longer starts a second compositor (picom.desktop etc.).
  * New debion-desktop-base package: DebION wallpaper, lock screen, login,
    GRUB background, vendor logos and Plymouth splash as the active
    desktop-base theme; the LightDM greeter uses the DebION login artwork.
  * Fix a possible Action Center crash on unusual drive labels and a
    compositor restart that ended pre-alpha12 sessions.

 -- Hugo Moniz do Rego <hugomonizdorego@angelinojoana.com>  Tue, 20 Oct 2026 08:00:00 +0900

sde (0.1.0~alpha11) unstable; urgency=medium

  * Four GTK 3/GTK 4 themes in /usr/share/themes: SDE Light, SDE Dark,
    SDE Aero and SDE Liquid Glass, each with SDE WM frames.
  * Start Menu: reliable search (no XIM, focus retry), Settings and session
    results, right-click Arrange menu, grid view and animations.
  * Ported from Eduka-Desktop: Effects page with compositor modes, report and
    restart; Action Center drives and power modes.
  * Liria SDE Tools extension and polished native application styling.

